===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} A [[comedian]] who plays a [[secondary]] or [[supporting]] role, especially as [[straight man]] and traditionally in [[vaudeville]] or [[burlesque]] [[theatre]].
#: {{ux|en|He grew disenchanted with playing '''second banana''' and never getting credit for the laughter.}}
# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} A person who serves in a supporting, secondary, or [[subsidiary]] capacity; an [[assistant]].
#: {{ux|en|The plumber left his '''second banana''' behind, to finish installing my new sink.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Michael Smyth|title=The lifeboat is filling up|titleurl=http://www.theprovince.com/lifeboat+filling/7166222/story.html|journal=The Province|date=30 August 2012
|passage=When you want to be the boss, but you can't, it's not a lot of fun to be '''second banana'''.}}

